#: ../../tools/uniprot_ref_tools.rst:32 91fe958671a34113b261f9e127ceb83e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a specific disease from "
"the UniProt controlled disease vocabulary by its ID. Returns the full "
"disease definition, alternative names, cross-references to "
"OMIM/MeSH/MedGen/SNOMED, and protein association counts. Example: "
"DI-01559 returns 'Breast-ovarian cancer, familial, 1' with links to "
"OMIM:604370 and MeSH:D001943."
msgstr ""

