#: ../../tools/uniprot_ref_tools.rst:157 b421c1455e8e445bbefac9292eaad518
msgid "**Name**: ``UniProtRef_search_keywords``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uniprot_ref_tools.rst:159 e8dbee12d51847dd8ac384ff17778fac
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the UniProt keyword controlled vocabulary. "
"Keywords are standardized terms used to annotate protein functions, "
"biological processes, cellular components, diseases, and technical "
"features in UniProt. Returns keyword IDs, categories, definitions, and "
"protein counts. Example: searching 'kinase' returns KW-0418 (Kinase), "
"KW-0723 (Serine/threonine-protein kinase), etc. with their definitions "
"and how many proteins carry each keyword."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uniprot_ref_tools.rst:163 74732fbf718c469282f434a124f64204
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for keywords. Examples: "
"'kinase', 'apoptosis', 'membrane', 'phosphorylation', 'zinc finger'."
msgstr ""

